# Phase 2 Log - Contract Dependencies for Orchestrator

## P2.CONTRACTS.CREATED
- Created packages/contracts package with complete TypeScript/Zod contract definitions
- Package structure: schemas/, adapters/, types/, __tests__/
- All exports properly configured in package.json with granular exports

## P2.CONTRACTS.SCHEMAS.EVENTS
- Defined 23 SSE event schemas matching services/agent/src/events.py
- Event categories: session lifecycle, sandbox, tool execution, file ops, browser, LLM content
- All schemas use discriminated union on 'type' field for type-safe event handling
- Includes: SessionCreatedEvent, ToolCallStartedEvent, ToolCallCompletedEvent, UsageEvent, ErrorEvent, etc.

## P2.CONTRACTS.SCHEMAS.TOOLS
- Defined tool input schemas for all agent service tools from services/agent/src/tools_definitions.py
- Categories: planning (show_plan), communication (message_notify_user, message_ask_user)
- File system: file_read, file_write, file_edit, file_search, directory_list, directory_tree
- Shell: shell_create, shell_exec, shell_read, shell_kill
- Browser: browser_action, browser_extract
- Search: web_search, web_fetch
- Code execution: python_run, node_run
- Image generation: image_generate

## P2.CONTRACTS.SCHEMAS.MESSAGES
- Message schema with support for text, reasoning, and source-url parts
- Session schema with status enum (active, archived, deleted)
- API key schema with rk_live_* key format validation
- All schemas support both string and Date types for timestamps

## P2.CONTRACTS.ADAPTERS.SSE
- parseSSEEvent: Parse SSE string to typed event object
- formatSSEEvent: Format typed event to SSE string
- parseSSEChunk: Parse multiple events from stream chunk
- formatSSEChunk: Format multiple events to chunk
- Handles [DONE] sentinel correctly
- Full roundtrip support (parse → format → parse preserves data)

## P2.CONTRACTS.ADAPTERS.TOOL
- anthropicToOpenAI: Convert Anthropic tool format to OpenAI format
- openAIToAnthropic: Convert OpenAI tool format to Anthropic format
- convertToolsToOpenAI: Batch conversion to OpenAI format
- convertToolsToAnthropic: Batch conversion to Anthropic format
- validateToolDefinition: Type guard for tool definitions
- Full roundtrip support for tool format conversion

## P2.CONTRACTS.TESTS
- 66 tests total, all passing (4 test files)
- __tests__/events.test.ts: 13 tests covering all event types
- __tests__/tools.test.ts: 17 tests covering all tool input schemas
- __tests__/messages.test.ts: 15 tests covering messages, sessions, API keys
- __tests__/adapters.test.ts: 21 tests covering SSE and tool format conversion
- Tests validate: schema validation, enum constraints, optional fields, type discrimination, roundtrip conversions

